    "background_story": "Jayda was a notorious gossip columnist known for her scathing reviews and dyslogistic articles. Her sharp tongue and quick wit made her a formidable force in the journalism world, but also earned her many enemies. With a keen eye for detail and a talent for ridicule, Jayda could destroy a reputation with a single sentence. Her targets ranged from corrupt politicians to self-absorbed celebrities, and she took great pleasure in exposing their flaws to the world. While some admired her fearlessness, others saw her as a ruthless mercenary, using her words to wound and humiliate. Despite the controversy surrounding her, Jayda remained unapologetic, believing that her brand of harsh criticism was necessary to keep the powerful in check.",
